    Source loop:   do { ... } while (cVar5 < 8);   (signed byte counter compare)
    The V850 SLEIGH set_OV_neg macro models the OV flag via a sub-register sign
    shift instead of `A s< 0`, so the BLT condition lifts to the p-code idiom
